---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import WhyDView from '../components/WhyDView.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About D-VIEW Solutions | Balcony Safety Engineering"
  description="D-VIEW Solutions is a premier architectural safety engineering company specializing in SS-316 invisible grills and containment systems in Andhra Pradesh."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.dviewsolutions.com/about"
>
  <Navbar client:load />

  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 bg-white min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-xs font-semibold text-[#16A34A] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          <span>Our Story & Metallurgy Ethos</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          ARCHITECTURAL SAFETY. <br />
          <span class="text-[#16A34A]">UNCOMPROMISED VISTAS.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          We founded D-VIEW Solutions with a single unwavering conviction: modern high-rise homeowners should never have to sacrifice their hard-earned panoramic horizons to keep their families safe.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-16">
        <p>
          Throughout coastal and riverfront cities in Andhra Pradesh—from the wave-kissed heights of Visakhapatnam to the breezy banks of Rajamahendravaram—thousands of luxury apartments were being caged in heavy, rusting iron bars. Beyond the aesthetic prison-like penalty, welded iron poses severe life-safety traps during emergencies.
        </p>
        <p>
          D-VIEW introduced a precision-engineered alternative: aerospace-grade SS-316 high-tensile wire rope anchored into structural concrete with heavy-duty 6063-T6 aluminum tracks. With breaking thresholds exceeding 400 kilograms per strand, our invisible grills provide impregnable fall protection while disappearing against the skyline.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <WhyDView />
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
